== Trivia ==
* The Dr. Fetus and {{I|Epic Fetus}} items are based on [[supermeatboy:Dr._Fetus|Dr. Fetus]], the main villain in [[wikipedia:Super Meat Boy|''Super Meat Boy'']], which is a game by Edmund McMillen (the creator of ''The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth'').
** This is also the reason why taking the item replaces tears with bombs (Dr. Fetus fires rockets in chapter 6's bossfight in ''Super Meat Boy''), and gives Isaac a top hat and a monocle (Dr. Fetus has a top hat and a monocle in ''Super Meat Boy'').
* This item is used in {{chal|Demo Man}}.
* In the original ''The Binding of Isaac'', Dr. Fetus was unlocked by beating {{e|Mom's Heart}} five times instead of nine.
* When the player unlocks Dr. Fetus, the item is labeled as "Fetus in a Jar" on the unlock screen.

